{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "site2": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Triage and route inbound emails with OpenAI, Slack, Gmail, and Sheets",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 17117,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Email Triage Agent (Metaworld demo)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4dcfec75-9bd4-4870-b823-599e0b06d9b7",
      "name": "Setup and workflow guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -640,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## Triage inbound email with AI\n\n### How it works\n\n1. IMAP polls a dedicated mailbox for new messages.\n2. OpenAI returns an urgent, invoice, or routine category with a confidence score and short reason.\n3. Scores below 0.70 stop for human review; confident results route to Slack, Google Sheets, or Gmail.\n4. Every completed path appends a decision record, and no path sends an email automatically.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Connect scoped IMAP, OpenAI, Slack, Google Sheets, and Gmail credentials.\n- [ ] Replace both `YOUR_*_SHEET_ID` values, Slack channels, and the Gmail label.\n- [ ] Configure a separate n8n failure workflow in Workflow Settings.\n- [ ] Test urgent, invoice, routine, low-confidence, and forced-failure examples with non-sensitive mail.\n- [ ] Review retained audit metadata before activating the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the categories in the AI prompt and Switch node together. Keep the confidence gate and final audit step when adding routes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1ad68673-82b5-4cc8-93fb-9952e73ed269",
      "name": "Read and classify guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Receive and classify\n\nRead new mail, request structured AI output, and stop uncertain classifications at the confidence gate."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4ebbf793-a0dc-4cd3-b036-9f7721432e91",
      "name": "Human review guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        680,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Review uncertain mail\n\nAlert `#triage-review` when confidence is below 0.70; a person decides what happens next."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "119792ba-e975-4355-adc9-f24ed6acb146",
      "name": "Routing guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        680,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Route confident results\n\nSend urgent alerts to Slack, append invoices to the ledger, and label routine mail in Gmail."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0dd01d0e-09fd-48f7-b291-0cddc8abf801",
      "name": "Audit guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1520,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Record every outcome\n\nAppend each completed route to `DecisionLog`; retain only metadata allowed by your policy."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Email Trigger (IMAP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "position": [
        0,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "AI Classify",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        220,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an email triage agent. Reply ONLY with JSON: {\"category\": \"urgent|invoice|routine\", \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0, \"reason\": \"one sentence\"}. urgent = outage, angry customer, legal, deadline today. invoice = bills, receipts, payment requests. routine = everything else."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Subject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\nBody:\n{{ $json.textPlain }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "Confidence Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        440,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.message.content.confidence }}",
              "value2": 0.7,
              "operation": "smaller"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "Route by Category",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "position": [
        760,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "urgent",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "urgent"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "invoice",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.category }}",
                    "rightValue": "invoice"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutputRename": "routine"
        },
        "fallbackOutput": "extra"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Alert Team Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        1040,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=:rotating_light: Urgent email from {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').item.json.from }} — {{ $('AI Classify').item.json.message.content.reason }}",
        "channel": "#ops-alerts"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "Append to Ledger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        1040,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": "Invoices",
        "documentId": "YOUR_LEDGER_SHEET_ID"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "Label + Archive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        1040,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "labelIds": [
          "Label_routine"
        ],
        "operation": "addLabels"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "Human Review Queue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        800,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=:thinking_face: Low-confidence email needs a human: {{ $('Email Trigger (IMAP)').item.json.subject }} ({{ $json.message.content.confidence }})",
        "channel": "#triage-review"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "Audit Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        1632,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": "DecisionLog",
        "documentId": "YOUR_AUDIT_SHEET_ID"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
